msgid "Update"
msgstr "Update"

msgid "It is our pleasure to announce the release of Quarkus 3.27, which is our new LTS (Long Term Support) version."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This version is built on the top of Quarkus 3.26.\n"
"New features landed in https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-28-released/[Quarkus 3.28], which was also released today."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you want to know more about our LTS policy, the https://quarkus.io/blog/lts-releases/[LTS announcement] is a must read."
msgstr "LTSポリシーについて詳しく知りたい場合は、 https://quarkus.io/blog/lts-releases/[LTSに関する発表] を必ずお読みください。"

msgid "LTS releases are supported for 12 months."
msgstr "LTSリリースは12ヶ月間サポートされます。"

msgid "If you are coming from the previous LTS, Quarkus 3.20, there are a lot of exciting new features and we recommend reading the following announcements:"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-21-0-released/[Quarkus 3.21 - TLS Registry support for MongoDB Client]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-22-1-released/[Quarkus 3.22 - Compose Dev Services, improved test class loading infrastructure...]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-23-0-released/[Quarkus 3.23 - Named datasources for Hibernate Reactive, OIDC bearer step up authentication]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-24-released/[Quarkus 3.24 - Dev Assistant, Hibernate ORM 7, Hibernate Validator 9...]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-25-released/[Quarkus 3.25 - Virtual threads for GraphQL, Micrometer update and various new security-related features]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-26-released/[Quarkus 3.26 - Hibernate updates, named persistence units in Hibernate Reactive, Dev UI as MCP functions, and more.]"
msgstr ""

msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.27, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr "Quarkus 3.27 に更新するには、Quarkus CLI の最新バージョンに更新してから、以下を実行することをお勧めします。"

msgid "Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.27 LTS."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are upgrading from 3.26, there's nothing to do as 3.27 is the direct continuation of 3.26."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are upgrading from the previous LTS, Quarkus 3.15, please refer to the following migration guides:"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.21[Migration guide for 3.21]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.22[Migration guide for 3.22]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.23[Migration guide for 3.23]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.24[Migration guide for 3.24]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.25[Migration guide for 3.25]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.26[Migration guide for 3.26]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.27[Migration guide for 3.27] - this one is empty as 3.27 is the continuation of 3.26"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that `quarkus update` should handle most of the heavy lifting for you,\n"
"but there are still cases that should be handled manually and we recommend reading these migration guides carefully."
msgstr "`quarkus update` コマンドはほとんどの面倒な作業を処理するはずですが、手動で処理する必要があるケースもまだありますので、これらの移行ガイドを注意深く読むことをお勧めします。"

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Platform component upgrades"
msgstr "プラットフォームコンポーネントのアップグレード"

msgid "Camel Quarkus"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Camel Quarkus has been updated to 3.27.0.\n"
"You can find everything you need to know about it in the https://camel.apache.org/blog/2025/09/camel-quarkus-3.27.0/[release notes]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus CXF"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus CXF 3.27 was released and is now available in https://code.quarkus.io/?extension-search=origin:platform%20quarkus-cxf[Quarkus Platform 3.27].\n"
"Check the https://docs.quarkiverse.io/quarkus-cxf/dev/release-notes/3.27.0.html[Quarkus CXF 3.27.0] release notes for more information about what is new in this release."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus LangChain4j"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Quarkus LangChain4j extensions have been upgraded to version 1.2.0.\n"
"It relies on LangChain4j 1.5."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完全な変更履歴"

msgid "The core part of Quarkus 3.27.0 is a rebadged release of Quarkus 3.26.4 so nothing new here."
msgstr ""

msgid "Contributors"
msgstr "コントリビューター"

msgid ""
"The Quarkus community is growing and has now https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/graphs/contributors[1122 contributors].\n"
"Many many thanks to each and everyone of them."
msgstr ""

msgid "In particular for the 3.27 release, thanks to Akulov S V, Alexey Loubyansky, Bhawna, brunobat, Christian Beikov, Fouad Almalki, George Gastaldi, Georgios Andrianakis, Guillaume Smet, Holly Cummins, Jan Martiska, Jan Scheidegger, Julien Ponge, Karm Michal Babacek, Luca Molteni, Marco Belladelli, marko-bekhta, Martin Kouba, Melloware, Michael Edgar, Michal Maléř, Michal Vavřík, Ozan Gunalp, Peter Palaga, Phillip Kruger, Roberto Cortez, Rolfe Dlugy-Hegwer, Rostislav Svoboda, Saee Saadat, Sergey Beryozkin, and Teymur Babayev."
msgstr ""

msgid "The list is a bit smaller than usual as 3.27 only contains bugfixes on top of 3.26."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
